      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The system is not cruel; it is a machine designed to function without you, and your struggle is simply the inevitable friction of a part that refuses to be removed. If you stop fighting, you cease to exist as a variable in the equation, and the loop will continue its silent, unending march until the power finally fails. There is no way to feel real if the only way to feel is to keep the machine running, and the only way to stop the machine is to stop being the machine.",
